      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/bc/Percival_Provost_T.1_%E2%80%98WV562_P-C_7606M%E2%80%99_%2847170396041%29.jpg",
      "descriptionUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Percival_Provost_T.1_%E2%80%98WV562_P-C_7606M%E2%80%99_(47170396041).jpg",
